  "description": "Shared domain value objects and cross-module contracts for the MPS platform (EPC/EVM/mining): strongly-typed ids (ProjectId, UserId, WorkPackageId, ControlAccountId), ManHours, PhaseType (E/P/C/PEM), RegulatoryRegime (Chilean HSE), and cross-module lookups/authorization contracts (IProjectAuthorizationService, IResourceProjectResolver, IProjectNameLookup, IProjectBacLookup). Public namespace is MPS.SharedKernel.* so it can replace the app's SharedKernel project transparently. Proprietary — requires a commercial agreement with Cayaqui.",
